Purpose:
To display all passengers currently present in the waiting list.
Since it is a circular queue, a do-while loop is useful because traversal should stop when the pointer reaches front again.
6.5 isEmpty() Operation
Purpose:
To check whether the waiting list contains any passenger.

6.6 isFull() Operation
In a linked-list implementation, the queue does not have a fixed size. It is considered full only when memory cannot be allocated for a new node.
6.8 Overflow Operation
Overflow occurs when memory is not available to create a new node.

6.9 Underflow Operation
Underflow occurs when deletion is attempted while the queue is empty

